Sample data
-----------

The optional sample-data packages (nmrium-samples.zip and the
nmrium-desktop-samples .deb) redistribute NMRium's own demo and teaching
dataset from the pinned submodule, under the same MIT license as NMRium above.

The LNFP III dataset under sample-data/lnfp3 originates from the EuroCarbDB /
CCPN "NMR software" sample CD (2007), credited to Bas Leeflang. See
sample-data/lnfp3/README.md for its provenance. That distribution did not
carry an explicit license statement; it is redistributed here as freely
distributed teaching data, credited to its originators. Contact us if you are
a rights holder and would like it removed.
